                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I spent 80 cents on this game, and I do not want them back because those 80 cents will forever be tied to the purchase of this game for me, and for that I feel nothing but disgust when thinking about them.\n\nThis is one of the worst games I have ever had the displeasure of coming across; literally, not one single thing about this game is good.\nThe best part by far is the enemy designs; those are actually excellent. Sadly, enemy variety is so terrible that you will be sick of them by the time you have reached the end.\n\nIn all other parts, this game feels like The Witcher if it were made by people who have never played or read The Witcher.\n\n\"Preparation for battles is key,\" it says on the difficulty select screen; prepare with what? There are literally only four items in this game to use.\n\"Balance skill points between three combat styles\" is the main selling point of the gameplay, but why should I when one of the playstyles is superior to all others in every way?\n\"Make choices that define the fate of the world.\" No, just straight up no, you never do that. You can become a demon that still behaves exactly like your regular MC, or in other words, like an asshole.\n\nCombat feels stiff, enemies have way too much HP and have two attacks at maximum that are both avoided by simply dodging backward, the story is terrible, the characters aren't good, and worst of all, the game hardly even works.\n\nThe lock-on straight-up refuses to... Lock on, the camera gets stuck behind environmental details, voice actors read the wrong lines (how does that even happen?), and after you have slogged through all of that, fought the same boss literally 6 times, and you are finally at the end, you come face to face with a final boss that is fundamentally broken, because dodging him triggers a counterattack that sucks you into the rest of his one-hit combo.\n\nAside from the final boss, the music is also terrible.\n\nWhat a disaster; do not buy this even as a joke; it is horrible.",
